{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-88-1","title":"Psalms 88:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 A prayer containing a grievous complaint.</p>\n<p>A.M. cir. 2473. B.C. cir. 1531. (Title.) for. or, of.Mahalath. 53:1; *title Maschil, etc. or, A Psalm of Heman the Ezrahite, givinginstruction. Supposed to have been written by Heman, son of Zerah, and grandson of Judah, on the oppression of the Hebrews in Egypt.</p>\n<p>Heman. 1Ki 4:31; 1Ch 2:6 Lord. 27:1,9; 51:14; 62:7; 65:5; 68:19; 79:9; 140:7; Ge 49:18; Isa 12:2 Lu 1:47; 2:30; Tit 2:10,13; 3:4-7 I have. 22:2; 86:3; Ne 1:6; Isa 62:6; Lu 2:37; 18:7; 1Th 3:10; 2Ti 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-2","title":"Psalms 88:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>79:11; 141:1,2; 1Ki 8:31; La 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-3","title":"Psalms 88:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>soul. 14,15; 22:11-21; 69:17-21; 77:2; 143:3,4; Job 6:2-4; Isa 53:3,10,11 La 3:15-19; Mt 26:37-39; Mr 14:33,34 life. 107:18; Job 33:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-4","title":"Psalms 88:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>counted. 28:1; 30:9; 143:7; Job 17:1; Isa 38:17,18; Eze 26:20; Jon 2:6 2Co 1:9 as a man. 31:12; 109:22-24; Ro 5:6; 2Co 13:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-5","title":"Psalms 88:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Free. Isa 14:9-12; 38:10-12; Eze 32:18-32 whom. 136:23; Ge 8:1; 19:29 cut. 16; 31:22; Job 6:9; 11:10; Isa 53:8 from thy hand. or, by thy hand.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-6","title":"Psalms 88:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>lowest. 40:2; 86:13; De 32:22 darkness. 143:3; Pr 4:19; La 3:2; Joh 12:46; Jude 1:6,13 deeps. 69:15; 130:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-7","title":"Psalms 88:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Thy wrath. 38:1; 90:7; 102:10; Job 6:4; 10:16; Joh 3:36; Ro 2:5-9; 1Pe 2:24 Re 6:16,17 with. 42:7; Jon 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-8","title":"Psalms 88:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>put. 18; 31:11; 143:4; 1Sa 23:18-20; Job 19:13-19; Joh 11:57 made. Isa 49:7; 63:3; Zec 11:8; Mt 27:21-25; Joh 15:23,24 I am shut. Job 12:14; 19:8; La 3:7-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-9","title":"Psalms 88:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Mine 38:10; 42:3; 102:9; Job 16:20; 17:7; La 3:48,49; Joh 11:35 called. 1; 55:17; 86:3 stretched. 44:20; 68:31; 143:6; Eze 17:11; Job 11:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-10","title":"Psalms 88:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Wilt thou.The interrogations in these verses imply the strongest negations.</p>\n<p>6:5; 30:9; 115:17; 118:17; Isa 38:18,19; Mr 5:35,36 shall. Job 14:7-12; Isa 26:19; Eze 37:1-14; Lu 7:12-16; 1Co 15:52-57</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-11","title":"Psalms 88:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>in destruction. 55:23; 73:18; Job 21:30; 26:6; Pr 15:11; Mt 7:13; Ro 9:22; 2Pe 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-12","title":"Psalms 88:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>dark. 143:3; Job 10:21,22; Isa 8:22; Mt 8:12; Jude 1:13 in the land 5; 31:12; Ec 2:16; 8:10; 9:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-13","title":"Psalms 88:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>and in. 5:3; 119:147,148; Mr 1:35 prevent thee.\"Come before thee;\" see on Ps 21:3.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-14","title":"Psalms 88:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Lord. 43:2; 77:7-9; Mt 27:46 hidest. 13:1; 44:24; 69:17; Job 13:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-15","title":"Psalms 88:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>afflicted. 73:14; Job 17:1,11-16; Isa 53:3 while. 22:14,15; Job 6:4; 7:11-16; Isa 53:10; Zec 13:7; Lu 22:44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-16","title":"Psalms 88:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>fierce. 38:1,2; 89:46; 90:7,11; 102:10; Isa 53:4-6; Ro 8:32; Ga 3:13 Re 6:17 cut me. Isa 53:8; Da 9:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-17","title":"Psalms 88:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>They. 22:16; 42:7; 69:1,2; 116:3; Job 16:12,13; 30:14,15; La 3:5-7 Mt 27:39-44 daily. or, all the day.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-88-18","title":"Psalms 88:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":88,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":88,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Lover. 8; 31:11; 38:11; Job 19:12-15 mine acquaintance.A figurative expression to denote that he now never saw them.</p>"}]}